# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the checkout
# machine's core.autocrlf setting - this repo is checked out on Windows
# (core.autocrlf=true here converts every text file to CRLF on checkout with
# no .gitattributes to override it), which made ESLint's prettier rule flag
# nearly every line of every file as a line-ending diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
